{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21322","headline":"听庾及之弹乌夜啼引 · 元稹","name":"听庾及之弹乌夜啼引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君弹乌夜啼，我传乐府解古题。\n良人在狱妻在闺，官家欲赦乌报妻。\n乌前再拜泪如雨，乌作哀声妻暗语。\n後人写出乌啼引，吴调哀弦声楚楚。\n四五年前作拾遗，谏书不密丞相知。\n谪官诏下吏驱遣，身作囚拘妻在远。\n归来相见泪如珠，唯说闲宵长拜乌。\n君来到舍是乌力，粧点乌盘邀女巫。\n今君爲我千万弹，乌啼啄啄泪澜澜。\n感君此曲有深意，昨日乌啼桐叶坠。\n当时爲我赛乌人，死葬咸阳原上地。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}